| Scenario | Example | Outcome |
|----------|---------|---------|
| **Empty** | `''` | `"No path supplied."` |
| **POSIX absolute** | `'/usr/local'` | `"2 parts, top-level folder: usr"` |
| **POSIX relative** | `'src/utils'` | `"2 parts, top-level folder: src"` |
